    "detailed_description": "CaS-Puz is a 3D puzzle platformer where everything is based on the position of the camera. You look at the wall from one side \u2014 it exists. You look from the other \u2014 you can go through it. But you have to open and close them for your own purposes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/6fe66277cff4b096a12ff74170140678.poster.avif?t=1736536784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/6fe66277cff4b096a12ff74170140678.webm?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/6fe66277cff4b096a12ff74170140678.mp4?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>However, you can't stand on open walls, and you can't jump away from them. During maneuvers, you will have to both open and close many walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/53e6ea51fbaa50d08ce0721cccfdada5.poster.avif?t=1736536784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/53e6ea51fbaa50d08ce0721cccfdada5.webm?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/53e6ea51fbaa50d08ce0721cccfdada5.mp4?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Easy to learn \u2014 hard to master.</strong> The controls are straightforward and standard \u2014 relative to the camera. Just to keep the direction of movement, you will have to change controls on the fly. <br><br><strong>A puzzle and a platformer.</strong> Before you make a jump, look around and think. Understand the correct sequence of jumps and camera turns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/967661ed4777498e1b27c5133da88f77.poster.avif?t=1736536784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/967661ed4777498e1b27c5133da88f77.webm?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/967661ed4777498e1b27c5133da88f77.mp4?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you are a fan of hardcore platformers, then in CaS-Puz you will definitely find a new challenge for yourself.",
    "about_the_game": "CaS-Puz is a 3D puzzle platformer where everything is based on the position of the camera. You look at the wall from one side \u2014 it exists. You look from the other \u2014 you can go through it. But you have to open and close them for your own purposes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/6fe66277cff4b096a12ff74170140678.poster.avif?t=1736536784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/6fe66277cff4b096a12ff74170140678.webm?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/6fe66277cff4b096a12ff74170140678.mp4?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>However, you can't stand on open walls, and you can't jump away from them. During maneuvers, you will have to both open and close many walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/53e6ea51fbaa50d08ce0721cccfdada5.poster.avif?t=1736536784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/53e6ea51fbaa50d08ce0721cccfdada5.webm?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/53e6ea51fbaa50d08ce0721cccfdada5.mp4?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Easy to learn \u2014 hard to master.</strong> The controls are straightforward and standard \u2014 relative to the camera. Just to keep the direction of movement, you will have to change controls on the fly. <br><br><strong>A puzzle and a platformer.</strong> Before you make a jump, look around and think. Understand the correct sequence of jumps and camera turns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/967661ed4777498e1b27c5133da88f77.poster.avif?t=1736536784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/967661ed4777498e1b27c5133da88f77.webm?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518250/extras/967661ed4777498e1b27c5133da88f77.mp4?t=1736536784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you are a fan of hardcore platformers, then in CaS-Puz you will definitely find a new challenge for yourself.",
    "short_description": "Your perspective changes the world. In this hardcore platformer, the existence of walls depends on the angle of your camera. A seemingly impassable level will transform once you look from a different angle, and every careless jump and camera movement can turn into a flight into the void.",
